                <h2 class="section-title">Hamare <span class="highlight-text">Advanced</span> Subjects</h2>
                <p class="text-muted">Smart Learning approach jo aapki Career-Focused taiyari ko asaan banaye.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Subject 1 -->
            <div class="col-md-4 mb-4">
                <div class="glass-card shadow-sm">
                    <div class="subject-icon">📊</div>
                    <h4 class="fw-bold">Advanced Accounting</h4>
                    <p class="text-muted">Professional standards ke saath <span class="highlight-text">Result-Oriented</span> coaching.</p>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled text-start">
                        <li>✅ <span class="fw-bold">Proven</span> Practice Sessions</li>
